msgctxt "192"
msgid "Everything okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "No... I feel like somebody's following me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Three days ago, I came to Tokyo to try making it on my own,\r\n"
"but I feel like some weirdo's been watching me the whole\r\n"
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"These are dangerous times. A girl like you shouldn't be\r\n"
"walking these streets alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"But I just transferred to a company here in Kamurocho,\r\n"
"and I don't know anybody..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "I'll bet you anything I'm being stalked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "You think you got a stalker?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Would you do me a favor and track down this creep who's\r\n"
"following me? I'll pay you for it, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Thank you so much! My name's Emi, by the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "What's yours, if you don't mind me asking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Okay, Kiryu-san. I'm counting on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "(Hmm, any suspicious-looking guys around here?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"(Bingo. I'll see if I can follow that guy without being\r\n"
"spotted.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"Cautiously follow the suspected stalker. <Color:7>If you get too\r\n"
"close, he'll spot you, but you'll lose him if you let him\r\n"
"get too far from you.<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Sorry. You'll have to ask somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"Oh... I understand. I mean, you could really get hurt\r\n"
"trying to do something like that, couldn't you? Sorry I\r\n"
"bothered you with such a weird request."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Still need help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Yes... I'm sure someone's still stalking me. I can barely\r\n"
"sleep at night, I'm so scared..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Um... Could you go track him down for me?"
msgstr ""

